# Title: Netsh Allow Group Policy on Microsoft Defender Firewall
# ID: 347906f3-e207-4d18-ae5b-a9403d6bcdef
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: frack113
# Date: 2022-01-09
# Tags: attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1686.003
# Description: Adversaries may modify system firewalls in order to bypass controls limiting network usage
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog (((process_exec="*advfirewall*" AND process_exec="*firewall*" AND process_exec="*set*" AND process_exec="*rule*" AND process_exec="*group=*" AND process_exec="*new*" AND process_exec="*enable=Yes*")) AND ((process_path="*\\netsh.exe") OR (process_name="netsh.exe")))
